sequenceDiagram
  participant p1 as You
  participant p2 as Your coding agent
  participant p3 as Your repository
  participant p4 as planr CLI
  participant p5 as GitHub
  Note over p1,p5: Phase: Specify
  p1->>p2: /planr:spec \"Add passwordless sign-in for existing accounts\"
  p2->>p1: asks only the questions that change the outcome
  p2->>p3: writes SPEC-001 under .planr/specs/
  Note over p1,p5: Phase: Plan
  p1->>p2: /planr:plan
  p2->>p3: writes the user stories and tasks: acceptance criteria and file-level change lists
  p1->>p4: planr sync
  p4->>p3: validates and repairs cross-references, offline, never by a model
  Note over p1,p5: Phase: Ship
  p1->>p2: /planr:ship, one task
  p2->>p3: reads the plan first, implements and verifies the task, records provenance
  p1->>p5: opens one PR per task
  p5->>p1: CI and review
  Note over p1,p5: Phase: Land
  p1->>p2: /planr:land
  p2->>p1: release readiness and the exact merge commands; the merge stays yours
  p1->>p5: merge
  Note over p1,p5: Phase: Release and operate
  p1->>p2: /planr:release, then /planr:operate
  p2->>p3: classifies what shipped, writes the release entry
  p2->>p1: operate readout: decisions, actions, risks, and evidence for the next spec
